Ni 1.500000
illum 2
Ps 0.000000
Pc 0.000000
Pcr 0.030000
aniso 0.000000
anisor 0.000000
map_Kd textures/baked/Glass_basecolor.png
map_Pm textures/baked/Glass_metallic.png
map_Pr textures/baked/Glass_roughness.png
map_Ke textures/baked/Glass_emission.png
map_d textures/baked/Glass_alpha.png
map_Bump -bm 1.000000 textures/baked/Glass_normal.png

